Komponen grid asimetris bergaya bento box yang modern, cocok untuk halaman portofolio, fitur produk, atau dashboard.

## Fitur

- Grid asimetris 3 kolom dengan span fleksibel
- Animasi hover yang halus
- 100% responsive (mobile-first)
- Dark mode ready
- Variasi warna preset

## Instalasi

```bash
npm install lucide-react clsx tailwind-merge
```

## Props

| Prop | Tipe | Default | Deskripsi |
|------|------|---------|-----------|
| items | `BentoItem[]` | — | Array item yang akan ditampilkan |
| className | `string` | `''` | Class tambahan untuk kustomisasi |
| columns | `3 \ 4` | `3` | Jumlah kolom grid |

### BentoItem

| Field | Tipe | Deskripsi |
|-------|------|-----------|
| title | `string` | Judul card |
| description | `string` | Deskripsi singkat |
| icon | `LucideIcon` | Icon dari lucide-react |
| color | `yellow` `dark` `white` `green` | Warna background |
| span | `1x1` `2x1` `1x2` `2x2` | Ukuran span grid |

### Kode Komponen

```tsx
import { type LucideIcon } from 'lucide-react';
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

interface BentoItem {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  icon: LucideIcon;
  color: 'yellow' | 'dark' | 'white' | 'green';
  span: '1x1' | '2x1' | '1x2' | '2x2';
}

interface BentoGridProps {
  items: BentoItem[];
  className?: string;
  columns?: 3 | 4;
}

const colorMap: Record<string, string> = {
  yellow: 'bg-amber-400 text-white',
  dark: 'bg-neutral-900 text-white',
  white: 'bg-white text-neutral-900 border border-neutral-200',
  green: 'bg-emerald-500 text-white',
};

const spanMap: Record<string, string> = {
  '1x1': 'col-span-1 row-span-1',
  '2x1': 'col-span-2 row-span-1',
  '1x2': 'col-span-1 row-span-2',
  '2x2': 'col-span-2 row-span-2',
};

export function BentoGrid({ items, className, columns = 3 }: BentoGridProps) {
  return (
    <div
      className={cn(
        `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-${columns} gap-4`,
        className
      )}
    >
      {items.map((item, i) => {
        const Icon = item.icon;
        return (
          <div
            key={i}
            className={cn(
              'rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg',
              colorMap[item.color],
              spanMap[item.span]
            )}
          >
            <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
              <Icon className="size-6" />
              <h3 className="font-bold text-lg">{item.title}</h3>
            </div>
            <p className="text-sm opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
              {item.description}
            </p>
          </div>
        );
      })}
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Contoh Penggunaan

```tsx
import { BentoGrid } from '@/components/ui/bento-grid';
import { Code2, Palette, Sparkles, Globe, Zap, Shield } from 'lucide-react';

const items = [
  {
    title: 'Fast Performance',
    description: 'Optimized for speed with lazy loading and code splitting.',
    icon: Zap,
    color: 'yellow' as const,
    span: '2x1' as const,
  },
  {
    title: 'Clean Code',
    description: 'TypeScript-first with strict typing and best practices.',
    icon: Code2,
    color: 'dark' as const,
    span: '1x1' as const,
  },
  {
    title: 'Beautiful UI',
    description: 'Modern design system with Tailwind CSS.',
    icon: Palette,
    color: 'white' as const,
    span: '1x1' as const,
  },
  {
    title: 'AI-Powered',
    description: 'Smart features powered by machine learning.',
    icon: Sparkles,
    color: 'green' as const,
    span: '1x1' as const,
  },
];

export function FeatureGrid() {
  return <BentoGrid items={items} columns={3} />;
}
```

## Variasi Layout

### Layout 3 Kolom (Default)

```
┌─────────────────┬─────────────┐
│   Main Feature  │   Stat 1    │
│   (2x2)         │   (1x1)     │
│                 ├─────────────┤
│                 │   Stat 2    │
│                 │   (1x1)     │
├─────────────────┴─────────────┤
│   Bottom Feature (2x1)        │
└───────────────────────────────┘
```

### Layout 4 Kolom

```
┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐
│ Feature 1│ Feature 2│ Feature 3│ Feature 4│
│ (1x1)    │ (1x1)    │ (1x1)    │ (1x1)    │
├──────────┴──────────┼──────────┴──────────┤
│   Highlight (2x1)   │   Side (2x1)        │
└─────────────────────┴─────────────────────┘
```
